<title>USA: Proteon names Steven Shedd as new CFO.</title>
<headline>Proteon names Steven Shedd as new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBORO, Mass. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Proteon Inc said on Monday that it had named Steven Shedd as vice president of finance and chief financial officer, succeeding Robert Connaughton, who served as chief financial officer until the end of April.</p>
<p>Shedd joins Proteon from Zoom Telephonics Inc, where he also held the position of vice president and chief financial officer, Proteon said in a statement.</p>
</text>
